			"parameters": {
				"content": "## User - Verify Email\n\nTests marking a user's email as verified.\n\n**Input:** `FIXTURE_UNVERIFIED_USER_ID` and `FIXTURE_UNVERIFIED_USER_EMAIL` — the runner signs up a brand-new user with a unique email for each run, because `emailVerified` can never flip back to `false` once it's `true`.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Manual trigger\n2. POST users/verify_email with the fresh user's id and primary email\n\n**Expected output:** User object with `emailVerified: true` — proving the actual flip from `false` → `true`.",
